.         gen sort_gender = -pla0009_v2  // female (2) → -2, male (1) → -1

. 
.         * Generate person number (so female = person_num 1, male = person_num
>  2)
.         bysort hid syear (sort_gender pid): gen person_num = _n

. 
.         * Drop helper variable
